  "research": [
    {
      "id": "r-cond-access",
      "name": "Microsoft 365 Conditional Access",
      "domain_id": "d-northgate",
      "status": "learning",
      "level": 2,
      "tags": [
        "m365",
        "security"
      ],
      "body": "## Why\nEvery client on M365 Business Premium can enforce MFA and device compliance without buying anything else.\n\n## Notes\n- **Named locations** first, then a break-glass account excluded from every policy\n- Report-only mode for two weeks before enforcing\n- `Sign-in logs` → Conditional Access tab tells you which policy fired\n- Break-glass account: long password in the client's password manager, MFA on a phone the owner holds",
      "links": [
        {
          "id": "l-ca-1",
          "label": "Microsoft Learn — Conditional Access",
          "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/conditional-access/"
        }
      ],
      "log": [
        {
